  "title": "Santa Fe 2017",
  "indexDescription": "Santa Fe trip with Ken and Dianne in 2017.",
  "description": "This was our first trip to Santa Fe with Ken and Dianne.  We stayed in a house in the hills a few miles out of town.  \n\nThis collection focuses on the town. We made side trips out of town that will be captured in other collections, like Taos Pueblo and Bandelier National Monument.",
